IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-HARVARD-1946-MULTIPLIER.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-TAPE-FAULT-FLAG   PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-DETENT-SHADOW.
   05 D1-MULTIPLICAND-A    PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-MULTIPLIER-B      PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-SHADOW-A-SNAP     PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
01 D2-COMMUTATOR-STAGE.
   05 D2-ACCUM-PRODUCT     PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-STATE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 0 TO D0-TAPE-FAULT-FLAG.
    MOVE 1000000 TO D1-MULTIPLICAND-A.
    MOVE 875 TO D1-MULTIPLIER-B.

    PERFORM STAGE-COMMUTATOR-MULTIPLICATION.
    PERFORM APPLY-MECHANICAL-DOG-LATCH.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.

    IF D1-SHADOW-A-SNAP == D1-MULTIPLICAND-A
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 4 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

STAGE-COMMUTATOR-MULTIPLICATION.
    comment Snapshot baseline in mechanical counter detent;
    MOVE D1-MULTIPLICAND-A TO D1-SHADOW-A-SNAP.
    comment Dual-path multiplier product;
    COMPUTE D2-ACCUM-PRODUCT = D1-MULTIPLICAND-A * D1-MULTIPLIER-B.
    EXIT.

APPLY-MECHANICAL-DOG-LATCH.
    IF D0-TAPE-FAULT-FLAG == 1
        MOVE D1-SHADOW-A-SNAP TO D2-COMMITTED-STATE
    ELSE
        COMPUTE D2-COMMITTED-STATE = D2-ACCUM-PRODUCT - ((D2-ACCUM-PRODUCT / D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME) * D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME)
    END-IF.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-COMMITTED-STATE - ((D2-COMMITTED-STATE / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
